      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Static open-panel specimen. Production uses a Radix modal with overlay, focus management and dismissal; this snippet does not implement dialog runtime.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-sheet\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"ds-sheet-title\" aria-describedby=\"ds-sheet-description\"><header class=\"ds-sheet-header\"><h2 class=\"ds-sheet-title\" id=\"ds-sheet-title\">France</h2><p class=\"ds-sheet-description\" id=\"ds-sheet-description\">Perspectives on business, people and purpose.</p></header><nav class=\"ds-sheet-nav\" aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\"><a class=\"ds-sheet-link\" href=\"/insights\">Insights <svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-sheet-link\" href=\"/#about\">About <svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-sheet-link\" href=\"/#speaking\">Speaking <svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-sheet-link\" href=\"/#projects\">Projects <svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-sheet-link\" href=\"/#connect\">Contact <svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a></nav><button class=\"ds-sheet-close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 6-12 12M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></section>",
      "css": ".ds-sheet{font-family:var(--font-body, 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif);position:relative;margin-left:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;width:75%;padding:32px 25px;background:var(--background,#f5f8f7);color:var(--foreground,#173e46);border-left:1px solid var(--line,#b9cdcb);box-shadow:0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / .1),0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / .1);overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain}.ds-sheet-header{padding:20px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.ds-sheet-title{margin:0;font-size:35px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ds-sheet-description{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-secondary,#436168)}.ds-sheet-nav{display:grid;margin-top:15px}.ds-sheet-link{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;min-height:65px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#b9cdcb);font-size:23px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ds-sheet-link:hover{color:#735c27}.ds-sheet-close{position:absolute;top:6px;right:6px;width:44px;height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:0;border-radius:2px;background:transparent;color:inherit;opacity:.7;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity 150ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-sheet-close:hover{opacity:1}.ds-sheet-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--foreground,#173e46);outline-offset:5px;border-radius:2px}.ds-sheet-close:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--foreground,#173e46);outline-offset:5px;border-radius:2px}@media(min-width:640px){.ds-sheet{max-width:384px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-sheet-close{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Article reading measure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Article heading precedes category metadata, followed by summary and 68ch prose; mobile uses the real article typography.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-article\"><header class=\"ds-article-header\"><h1 class=\"ds-article-title\">What does meaningful growth look like?</h1><p class=\"ds-article-meta\">Business strategy</p><p class=\"ds-article-summary\">Looking beyond the next milestone to the kind of business we want to build.</p></header><div class=\"ds-prose\"><p>Growth can open new possibilities.</p><p>It also creates a reason to pause and ask what success should mean: for a business, for the people within it, and for the communities around it.</p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-article{font-family:var(--font-body, 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif);max-width:1050px;color:var(--foreground,#173e46)}.ds-article-meta{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--text-secondary,#436168)}.ds-article-title{max-width:22ch;margin:16px 0 23px;font-size:clamp(42px,5.4vw,72px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em;text-wrap:balance}.ds-article-summary{max-width:65ch;margin:14px 0 0;font-size:23px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text-secondary,#436168)}.ds-prose{max-width:68ch;font-size:21px;line-height:1.7;margin:40px 0 48px}.ds-prose p{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}.ds-prose p+p{margin-top:1.2em}@media(max-width:640px){.ds-article-meta{font-size:14px}.ds-article-title{font-size:42px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ds-article-summary{font-size:20px}.ds-prose{font-size:19px;margin:30px 0 38px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Perspective Catalogue",
    "overview": "An author-led, upright publication identity: clear humanist typography, pale chalk ground, blue-green ink, a cool author surface and a restrained gold reading action. The tone is sophisticated, warm and professional without corporate decoration. Large type, open space and explicit dividers carry the hierarchy.\n\nThe system uses real photographs in rectangular crops and keeps editorial content easy to scan and read. This document describes the implemented website. The generated decision mockup is a composition critique reference; it is not an approved comp or a claim of pixel fidelity.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Upright Hanken Grotesk across display, navigation and reading text.",
      "Chalk and blue-green surfaces with gold used for reading and selected supporting details.",
      "Flat, rule-separated content with rectangular photography.",
      "Responsive reading measures and visible keyboard focus."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Accent Mapping Rule",
        "body": "The CSS property `--accent` is reading gold. Tailwind's `--color-accent` maps to the cool surface for shadcn ghost and outline treatments. Do not treat these as interchangeable.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use upright Hanken Grotesk and the established reading measures.",
      "**Do** distinguish the gold reading action from the cool shadcn accent surface.",
      "**Do** use rules and tonal surfaces to organize content.",
      "**Do** preserve responsive crops, visible focus, reduced-motion behavior and semantic navigation.",
      "**Do** keep editorial previews visibly disclosed until approved writing replaces them."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** add stock geometric decoration or repeated italic slogans.",
      "**Don't** return to the rejected cream, olive and terracotta treatment.",
      "**Don't** turn every content section into an identical rounded card.",
      "**Don't** invent input fields, publishing controls or biography claims to fill visual space.",
      "**Don't** describe the decision mockup as an approved comp or claim pixel fidelity."
    ]
  }
